Z||000000||fierosound||06-28-2001||09:18 PM||||  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/wheels2.jpg">  <P>My car has been repainted to a 2001 GM color - Light Toreador Red Pearl Metallic code B9523, Dupont-53/307D <P>The car has been lowered.  We cut 1/2 coil from front springs, installed Eibach's in rear.  Munroe's on all 4 corners.  <P>Wheels are Prime Wheels Model 260 16"x7".  More details here:   <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/010680.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/010680.html</A>   <P>Tires are Michelin Pilot 205/55/16-front and 225/55/16-rear.  Suspension & tires combo rides firmer than stock, but handles extremely well.<P>More on my car: <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/calgaryfieros/tonys87.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/calgaryfieros/tonys87.htm</A> <BR><p>[This message has been edited by fierosound (edited 06-28-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||beachbomb||06-28-2001||09:21 PM||||I LIKE IT!!!!!<P>jim(2 '84 Indys)||||reg||1
Z||000002||rodmcneill||06-29-2001||12:59 AM||||Looks great!||||reg||1
